@startuml
[*] --> Initialization
Initialization -> Waiting : Success
Initialization -> Unloading : Failure

Waiting -> ProcessingUpdates : Detect Update
ProcessingUpdates -> NotifyingOperators : Evaluate Significant
NotifyingOperators -> Waiting : Notification Complete

Waiting -> Unloading : No Updates
Unloading -> Cleanup : Start Cleanup
Cleanup -> Termination : Cleanup Complete
Termination --> [*]

note right of Initialization: System starts here
@enduml
